nuinely play as if they’ve been lobotomized. I have seen people ignore revives, intentionally throw runs and somehow get lost on a map they’ve played for 100+ hours on.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately however, I still ended up 100%ing it twice because It is addictive and youll have fun most of the time, especially with friends.\r\n7/10 would recommend", "timestamp_created": 1778884666, "timestamp_updated": 1778884666, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "225608055", "author": {"steamid": "76561199084920749", "personaname": "RUM", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199084920749/", "num_games_owned": 112, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 6013, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6013, "last_played": 1766876793, "avatar": "baed896d4112702e48b6fade6029a2708269e97d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun, Exciting. has a little repetition.", "timestamp_created": 1778882535, "timestamp_updated": 1778882535, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}]}